      ],
      "in_summary": false
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 16,
      "text": "While the proceedings are pending at the stage of framing of charges, Dr. Menaka Guruswamy,\nlearned Senior Counsel for the petitioner, draws my attention to an order of the Supreme Court in Mukesh & Ors. v. State of Uttar Pradesh & Ors.",
      "rhetorical_role": "NONE",
      "start": 1662,
      "end": 1898,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Menaka Guruswamy",
          "label": "OTHER_PERSON",
          "start": 1736,
          "end": 1752
        },
        {
          "text": "Supreme Court",
          "label": "COURT",
          "start": 1835,
          "end": 1848
        },
        {
          "text": "Mukesh & Ors. v. State of Uttar Pradesh & Ors",
          "label": "PRECEDENT",
          "start": 1852,
          "end": 1897
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 17,
      "text": "[SLP(CRL.) 12354/2024, dated 29.11.2024] which states that the remedy of discharge may not be adequate in a case where the accused alleges abuse of process.",
      "rhetorical_role": "NONE",
      "start": 1899,
      "end": 2055,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "SLP(CRL.) 12354/2024",
          "label": "CASE_NUMBER",
          "start": 1900,
          "end": 1920
        },
        {
          "text": "29.11.2024",
          "label": "DATE",
          "start": 1928,
          "end": 1938
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 18,
      "text": "She also relies upon the judgment of the Supreme Court in Achin Gupta v. State of Haryana & Anr. [(2025) 3 SCC 756], which dealt specifically with a case arising out of matrimonial disputes.",
      "rhetorical_role": "NONE",
      "start": 2056,
      "end": 2246,
      "entities": [
        {
